<div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
	<p>Sign in with <code>agy acp --login</code> and paste the code from Google. For a login inside this Agent, disable host login, save the Agent, then run the command in Files → Terminal.</p>
	<p>For an API key, add <code>GEMINI_API_KEY</code> in Runner → Environment and set <code>"modelProvider": "gemini"</code> in <code>~/.gemini/antigravity-cli/settings.json</code>. Models and thinking levels appear after the first session connects.</p>
</div>
